sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend
    participant Clerk
    participant Backend
    participant DB

    Note over User,DB: Sign Up Flow
    
    User->>Frontend: Click "Sign Up"
    Frontend->>Clerk: Redirect to Clerk sign-up
    User->>Clerk: Enter email/password or OAuth
    Clerk->>Clerk: Create user account
    Clerk->>Frontend: Return to app with session token
    Frontend->>Backend: POST /api/webhooks/clerk<br/>(user.created event)
    Backend->>Backend: Verify webhook signature
    Backend->>DB: Create user record<br/>(clerkId, email, name, coins: 100)
    DB-->>Backend: User created
    Backend-->>Frontend: 200 OK
    Frontend->>Frontend: Store Clerk session token
    Frontend->>Frontend: Redirect to /onboarding
    
    Note over User,DB: Sign In Flow
    
    User->>Frontend: Click "Sign In"
    Frontend->>Clerk: Redirect to Clerk sign-in
    User->>Clerk: Enter credentials
    Clerk->>Clerk: Verify credentials
    Clerk->>Frontend: Return to app with session token
    Frontend->>Frontend: Store Clerk session token
    Frontend->>Frontend: Redirect to /dashboard<br/>(or previous page)
    
    Note over User,DB: Authenticated Request Flow
    
    User->>Frontend: Perform action (e.g., request session)
    Frontend->>Frontend: Get Clerk session token
    Frontend->>Backend: HTTP Request<br/>Authorization: Bearer <token>
    Backend->>Clerk: Verify JWT token
    Clerk-->>Backend: Token valid, user info
    Backend->>Backend: Extract userId from token
    Backend->>DB: Query/Update data
    DB-->>Backend: Data response
    Backend-->>Frontend: 200 OK with data
    Frontend-->>User: Display result
    
    Note over User,DB: Token Expiration Flow
    
    User->>Frontend: Perform action
    Frontend->>Backend: HTTP Request with expired token
    Backend->>Clerk: Verify JWT token
    Clerk-->>Backend: Token expired/invalid
    Backend-->>Frontend: 401 Unauthorized
    Frontend->>Clerk: Refresh token or redirect to sign-in
    Clerk->>Frontend: New session token
    Frontend->>Backend: Retry request with new token
    Backend->>DB: Process request
    DB-->>Backend: Data response
    Backend-->>Frontend: 200 OK
    Frontend-->>User: Display result

